### 1. 测试健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 2. 测试注册接口（学号必须 12 位纯数字，密码 8-32 位）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "302026000001",
    "name": "张三",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 3. 测试登录接口（用上面注册的账号）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "302026000001",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 4. 测试获取当前用户（把 <accessToken> 换成登录返回的 token）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### 5. 测试退出登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### 6. 测试获取物品列表（支持 keyword/type/category/itemStatus/location/sort/page/pageSize）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items?page=1&pageSize=10&sort=latest

### 7. 测试关键词搜索（标题/描述/地点模糊匹配）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items?keyword=校园卡

### 8. 测试筛选（类型 + 分类 + 状态组合）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items?type=lost&category=id_card&itemStatus=open

### 9. 测试获取物品详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1

### 10. 发布物品（需登录，默认进入待审核）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "lost",
    "title": "丢失的校园卡",
    "description": "在图书馆二楼自习区丢失校园卡一张",
    "category": "id_card",
    "location": "图书馆二楼",
    "contact": "微信: test2026"
}

### 11. 编辑自己的发布（至少一个字段，修改后回到待审核）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "location": "图书馆三楼"
}

### 12. 删除自己的发布
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### 13. 我的发布（reviewStatus/itemStatus 筛选）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/me/items?reviewStatus=pending
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### 14. 上传图片（form-data 字段 file，单张不超过 5MB，返回图片 URL）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/uploads/images
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 15. 提交认领申请（仅审核通过且开放中的招领可申请；发布者本人与重复申请返回 409/13001）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/2/claims
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "这是我掉的伞，伞面有白色条纹，把手有个小缺口",
    "contact": "QQ: 999888"
}

### 16. 查看物品的认领申请（仅发布者或管理员可见）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/2/claims
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### 17. 我的认领申请（status 可选 pending/approved/rejected/cancelled）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/me/claims?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### 18. 取消自己的认领申请（仅 pending 可取消）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/claims/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### 19. 管理员物品列表（lost_admin/system_admin；reviewStatus/itemStatus/keyword 筛选，待审核优先）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/items
Authorization: Bearer <adminAccessToken>

### 20. 审核物品（approved/rejected/offline，拒绝时建议附 rejectReason）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/items/5/review
Authorization: Bearer <adminAccessToken>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reviewStatus": "approved"
}

### 21. 修改物品状态（open/claimed/resolved/closed，仅审核通过的物品）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/items/1/status
Authorization: Bearer <adminAccessToken>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "itemStatus": "claimed"
}

### 22. 审核认领申请（通过时事务内同步物品为 claimed；同一物品仅允许一个通过）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/claims/2/status
Authorization: Bearer <adminAccessToken>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "approved",
    "reviewReason": "描述与物品信息吻合，予以通过"
}
